# Reference Point — Feature Card Headline (`h4` in `.disc-card-head`)

When the user says **"reference point"** for a discovery/feature card title (e.g. "Social Proof Strip"), match plain `h4` inside `header.disc-card-head` in `.disc-card`.

## Structure

```html
<article class="disc-card">
  <header class="disc-card-head">
    <h4>Social Proof Strip</h4>
    <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="friction-label">User Friction</p>
    <p class="friction">Users leave to find third-party social proof — product details feel biased.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="disc-card-stage">…</div>
  <footer class="disc-card-foot">…</footer>
</article>
```

Use a plain `h4` — no `.title`, `.display`, or extra classes.

## Visual spec

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Element | `h4` (no class) inside `.disc-card-head` |
| Font | `var(--serif)` (Instrument Serif) |
| Size | `24px` |
| Weight | `400` |
| Style | **italic** |
| Color | `var(--ink-deep)` |
| Line-height | `1.15` |
| Margin | `0` |

## Full card head stack

1. **`h4`** — italic serif feature name ← this reference
2. `.rule` — bronze hairline divider (`rgba(162, 130, 90, 0.35)`)
3. `.friction-label` — uppercase sans label (`11px`, weight 700, `var(--label)`)
4. `.friction` — friction body (`13px`, weight 500, `var(--ink-deep)`)

## Card shell context

| Layer | Class | Notes |
|-------|-------|-------|
| Card | `.disc-card` | `--bg-card` fill, `--bronze` border, `16px` radius |
| Head | `.disc-card-head` | `--bg-soft` background, `20px 16px 14px` padding |
| Stage | `.disc-card-stage` | `#ebe4d8` mockup area |
| Foot | `.disc-card-foot` | `.sol-label` + solution list |

## vs other headlines

| Class / element | Use |
|-----------------|-----|
| `h4` in `.disc-card-head` | Feature card title — italic serif, `24px` |
| `h3` in `.gap-card` | Gap punchline — italic, `--h3`, `var(--ink)` |
| `h3.title` in `.overview-sub-head` | Subsection head — regular (not italic), `--title-sm` |
| `h4` in `.ai-touchpoint-head` | AI touchpoint card — same italic serif, `24px` |

## Do not

- Add `.title` or `.display` to feature card headlines.
- Use sans-serif or remove italic.
- Use `<h3>` — keep `h4` for card-level hierarchy inside `.disc-card`.
